WEBSITE STYLE SYSTEM

Create the website using this exact visual direction:

1. OVERALL STYLE
Style:
- Dark-first editorial dashboard
- Game/mod documentation aesthetic
- Soft brutalism
- Minimal, clean, technical UI
- Slightly mysterious / premium feeling
- Rounded cards and controls
- Thin borders
- Very subtle shadows
- Lots of breathing room
- Strong typography hierarchy
- Small micro-interactions instead of flashy animations
The website should feel like:
"Technical documentation + game control panel + modern editorial website"

Avoid:(what i dont like soo much ill code then later..)
- Neon cyberpunk
- Excessive gradients
- Glassmorphism
- Huge glowing effects
- Excessive animations
- Generic AI-looking UI
- Excessive rounded bubble elements
