- Smooth transition

Submenu:

- Smaller text
- Slight indentation
- Muted colour

10. TOP NAVIGATION

Keep navigation minimal.

Desktop:
Logo / title on left
Navigation links in center/right

Mobile:
Hamburger button

Hamburger button:

- Circular or rounded square
- Dark panel
- Thin border
- Small icon

When opened:
hamburger → X

11. THEME SWITCH

Use a Dark / Light switch.

Dark mode:
Moon icon

Light mode:
Sun icon

Switch should:

- Change the CSS variables
- Change icon
- Play a subtle UI sound
- Remember the user's selection using localStorage

12. SOUND UI

Use subtle Web Audio API generated sounds.

Do NOT use loud sound effects.

Suggested sound types:

Navigation:
short soft tone

Toggle:
small click

Slider:
very short tick

Spawn/action:
slightly deeper confirmation tone

Theme change:
soft two-tone transition

Sound should feel like:
"physical interface feedback"

Not:
"arcade game sound"

