14. TOGGLES

Toggle design:

Off:
dark/neutral

On:
accent orange

Rounded track:
999px

Circular thumb:
small

Example:

.toggle {
width: 44px;
height: 24px;
border-radius: 999px;
border: 1px solid #332B33;
background: #211B21;
}

.toggle.active {
background: #D97832;
}

.toggle-thumb {
width: 18px;
height: 18px;
border-radius: 50%;
transition: transform 160ms ease;
}

15. SLIDERS

Use thin technical sliders.

