19. RESPONSIVE DESIGN

Mobile-first.

Desktop:

- Two-column feature grids
- Sidebar/navigation
- Wider content area

Mobile:

- One-column cards
- Sliding sidebar
- Fixed bottom navigation
- Larger touch targets
- Reduced heading size

Use approximately:

@media (min-width: 800px)

for major layout changes.

