23. GENERAL SPACING

Use generous spacing.

Page padding:
16px mobile
24px tablet
32px+ desktop

Card gap:
14px–20px

Section spacing:
60px–100px

Do not cram everything together.

24. BORDER RADIUS

Main cards:
14–18px

Buttons:
999px

Pills:
999px

Inputs:
10–14px

Sidebar items:
10–12px

Avoid making every element extremely rounded.

25. SHADOWS

Keep shadows extremely subtle.

Prefer borders over shadows.

Example:

box-shadow:
0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.12);

Do NOT use:
huge glowing shadows
neon glows
strong drop shadows

26. ANIMATION PHILOSOPHY

Animations should communicate state.

Good:

- sidebar sliding
- menu expanding
- button pressing
- toggle switching
- icon changing
- active navigation
- theme transition
- copy confirmation

Avoid:

- constant floating
- excessive particles
- spinning everything
- huge entrance animations

27. INTERACTION PHILOSOPHY

Every control should visibly respond.

Examples:

CLICK MENU
→ sidebar slides in
→ hamburger becomes X
→ overlay appears

CLICK TOGGLE
→ switch moves
→ colour changes
→ value updates
→ subtle sound

CLICK COPY
→ clipboard copies
→ icon becomes ✓
→ returns after ~1 second

CHANGE SLIDER
→ value updates immediately

SCROLL
→ active navigation section updates

CHANGE THEME
→ entire colour system changes smoothly

ENABLE SOUND
→ UI sounds become active

